# Keep the Docker build context small and avoid ever copying local
# build output, logs, or vault data into an image layer.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/vault/
**/logs/
.git/
.gitignore
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
docs/
.claude/
CHANGELOG.md
HANDOVER.md
README.md

# Test projects (including tests/e2e's Node/Playwright tooling) are never
# part of the published/runtime image - the Dockerfile's build stage only
# ever COPYs src/DotNotes.Api and src/DotNotes.Core explicitly, but this
# entry keeps it true even if that ever changes to a broader COPY.
tests/
